notes:        Unmodified native-window capture from code commit 76ecce78ce73904989ad74af45c3753d19f6438a on hosted Windows 2025. The generated synthetic.ecproj visibly shows the blurred checkerboard displaced downward by the saved value + [0, 20] position expression. Microsoft Basic Render Driver rejected optional Classic 3D initialization before CPU preview. This does not establish interactive expression editing, broader effects, or GPU rendering.
